If it is only the line breaks, you can probably convert them by opening
the patch in some editor and saving. If the file size increases, the
editor converted the line breaks. I don't know whether the patch utility
you use needs that.

But that is quite a big patch, as it is a combination of several different
patches, and if you already have some other patches applied before it, it is
quite possible that some parts of the big patch change some parts of the
code that are already changed by the patch(es) you installed earlier, thus
creating a conflict that the patch utility just can't handle. In that
case, you probably need to do some of the changes manually.

